{
  "info": {
    "name": "API Matriculación → GIM",
    "description": "Servicios de la API que emite títulos de crédito de Matriculación en GIM.\n\nUso:\n1. Importar esta colección y el entorno (postman/diario_20260505.postman_environment.json).\n2. Seleccionar el entorno.\n3. Ejecutar 'Auth / Obtener token': el token se guarda solo en la variable accessToken.\n4. Ejecutar el resto. Cambiar la variable idOrden para emitir una orden nueva.\n\nLa colección no contiene secretos: clientSecret vive en el entorno.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('accessToken guardado (expira en ' + body.expires_in + ' s)');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "token"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Revisión vehicular (rubro 813)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Emitir título",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('ultimoIdTitulo', body.id_titulo);",
                  "  console.log('Título emitido: id ' + body.id_titulo + ', número ' + body.numero_titulo + ', valor ' + body.valor);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_orden\": \"{{idOrden}}\",\n  \"numero_identificacion\": \"1104971302\",\n  \"vehiculo\": {\n    \"placa\": \"LBA-2213\",\n    \"chasis\": \"221\",\n    \"motor\": \"212\",\n    \"anio\": 2015,\n    \"cilindraje\": 212,\n    \"tonelaje\": 12,\n    \"fabricante_id\": 241,\n    \"tipo_vehiculo_id\": 33\n  },\n  \"tipo_general\": \"TAXIS\",\n  \"numero_revision\": \"PRIMERA\",\n  \"explicacion\": \"PRUEBA API MATRICULACION - REVISION VEHICULAR LBA-2213 2026\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular"]
            },
            "description": "Emite el título en GIM (813 + sub-rubro 444) en estado PENDIENTE y devuelve id_titulo.\n\nCampos opcionales: vehiculo.chasis, motor, anio, cilindraje, tonelaje y referencia (si no se envía, toma la explicación).\n\ntipo_general: BUSES, BUSETAS, LIVIANOS, MOTOS, PESADOS, PLATAFORMAS, TAXIS.\nnumero_revision: PRIMERA, SEGUNDA, TERCERA, CUARTA, ORDINARIA."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar por orden",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular/orden/{{idOrden}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular", "orden", "{{idOrden}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Casos de error",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Orden repetida → 409",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('409 ORDEN_YA_EMITIDA', () => {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error_code).to.eql('ORDEN_YA_EMITIDA');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id_orden\": \"{{idOrden}}\",\n  \"numero_identificacion\": \"1104971302\",\n  \"vehiculo\": {\n    \"placa\": \"LBA-2213\",\n    \"fabricante_id\": 241,\n    \"tipo_vehiculo_id\": 33\n  },\n  \"tipo_general\": \"TAXIS\",\n  \"numero_revision\": \"PRIMERA\",\n  \"explicacion\": \"REPETIDA\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular"]
                },
                "description": "Ejecutar después de 'Emitir título' con el mismo idOrden: no emite otro título y devuelve el existente."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Contribuyente no registrado → 422",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('422 CONTRIBUYENTE_NO_REGISTRADO', () => {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error_code).to.eql('CONTRIBUYENTE_NO_REGISTRADO');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id_orden\": \"PRUEBA-ERROR-CONTRIBUYENTE\",\n  \"numero_identificacion\": \"9999999999\",\n  \"vehiculo\": {\n    \"placa\": \"LBA-2213\",\n    \"fabricante_id\": 241,\n    \"tipo_vehiculo_id\": 33\n  },\n  \"tipo_general\": \"TAXIS\",\n  \"numero_revision\": \"PRIMERA\",\n  \"explicacion\": \"ERROR ESPERADO\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Tipo general inválido → 422",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('422 VALIDATION_ERROR', () => {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error_code).to.eql('VALIDATION_ERROR');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id_orden\": \"PRUEBA-ERROR-VALIDACION\",\n  \"numero_identificacion\": \"1104971302\",\n  \"vehiculo\": {\n    \"placa\": \"LBA-2213\",\n    \"fabricante_id\": 241,\n    \"tipo_vehiculo_id\": 33\n  },\n  \"tipo_general\": \"AVIONES\",\n  \"numero_revision\": \"PRIMERA\",\n  \"explicacion\": \"ERROR ESPERADO\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular"]
                },
                "description": "tipo_general fuera del catálogo: la API rechaza la petición antes de consultar GIM."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Orden inexistente → 404",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('404 ORDEN_NOT_FOUND', () => {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error_code).to.eql('ORDEN_NOT_FOUND');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular/orden/NO-EXISTE",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular", "orden", "NO-EXISTE"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Sin token → 401",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('401 MISSING_TOKEN', () => {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error_code).to.eql('MISSING_TOKEN');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revision-vehicular/orden/{{idOrden}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "revision-vehicular", "orden", "{{idOrden}}"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
